flowchart TD
    subgraph Resolution[Configuration and generation resolution]
        Spec[Current model specification]
        CLI[Input selection and window options]
        Routes[Compact route catalogs]
        Config[Named multi-source input config]
        Request[Compact MonitorConfig request]
        Sources[InputSources owned local source set]
        Resolve[Resolve model inputs and MonitorConfig]
        Resolved[Generation-local immutable ResolvedInput]
        ControlSelect[Control selection: single source inferred; multiple sources require exactly one reconfiguration_route]
        RouteOverride[CLI may override the control route only]

        CLI --> Sources
        Routes --> Sources
        Config --> Sources
        Spec --> Resolve
        Sources --> Resolve
        Request --> Resolve
        Resolve --> Resolved
        Sources --> ControlSelect
        RouteOverride --> ControlSelect
    end

    subgraph Generation[One input generation]
        Open[Open resolved source bindings]

        subgraph Adapters[Reusable source adapters]
            Live[MQTT Redis and ROS]
            Replay[File replay]
            Rows[Map and in-memory rows]
            Manual[Manual input]
            Dedicated[Dedicated control-only source supported]
        end

        Compose[Compose data in observed source order]
        Batch[Public InputBatch: ordered logical ticks]

        subgraph Public[Public logical API]
            Update[Public InputUpdate: variable and value]
            Tick[Logical tick: one or more atomic updates]
            Stream[Public data-only InputStream]
        end

        subgraph PrivateStorage[Crate-private physical storage]
            Storage[InputBatchStorage]
            Segments[InputSegment runs]
            Shapes[Singleton ticks, simultaneous tick, or packed rows]
        end

        OrdinaryEvents[Private data events; control impossible]
        ReconfigAdapter[Private reconfigurable data/control adapter]
        ReconfigEvents[Private data or control events]

        subgraph Windowing[Shared private window driver when configured]
            Driver[One driver for ordinary and reconfigurable input]
            Threshold[Update limit is a soft flush threshold; never split one logical tick]
            BatchWindow[Batch mode preserves tick boundaries]
            AtomicWindow[Atomic-step mode uses last-update-wins]
            Barrier[Control flushes pending data, emits terminal barrier, then stops]
        end

        Open --> Live
        Open --> Replay
        Open --> Rows
        Open --> Manual
        Open --> Dedicated
        Live --> Compose
        Replay --> Compose
        Rows --> Compose
        Manual --> Compose
        Compose --> Batch
        Batch --> Tick
        Tick --> Update
        Batch -. implemented by .-> Storage
        Storage --> Segments
        Segments --> Shapes

        Batch --> OrdinaryEvents
        Compose --> ReconfigAdapter
        ControlSelect --> ReconfigAdapter
        Dedicated --> ReconfigAdapter
        ReconfigAdapter --> ReconfigEvents
        OrdinaryEvents --> Driver
        ReconfigEvents --> Driver
        Threshold --> Driver
        Driver --> BatchWindow
        Driver --> AtomicWindow
        Driver -->|control| Barrier
        BatchWindow --> Stream
        AtomicWindow --> Stream
    end

    subgraph Execution[Runtime execution]
        Ordinary[Ordinary runtime consumes data-only stream]
        Reconfigurable[Reconfigurable semi-sync runtime]
        Transfer[Parse replacement and transfer context]
        End[Generation completion]

        Stream --> Ordinary
        BatchWindow -->|private data item| Reconfigurable
        AtomicWindow -->|private data item| Reconfigurable
        Barrier --> Reconfigurable
        Reconfigurable --> Transfer
        Ordinary --> End
        Transfer --> End
    end

    Resolved --> Open
    ControlSelect --> Open
    Transfer -. replacement generation .-> Request
